  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>The Free Worlds League's fractious politics have always made centralized BattleMech procurement difficult, pushing the FWLM toward heavy investment in conventional infantry to fill the gaps. Towing crew-served light gauss rifles, these platoons trade the raw stopping power of full-size gauss weapons for improved mobility and a lighter logistics footprint, while still delivering magnetically accelerated rounds at ranges that exceed conventional autocannon.</p>"
